WEBVTT

00:03.570 --> 00:06.090
It's not fun...

00:07.100 --> 00:10.940
I'm not with friends or with Tama...

00:12.740 --> 00:14.000
Friends...

00:20.350 --> 00:22.340
Why are you crying?

00:30.530 --> 00:33.020
Are you thinking about your friends?

00:38.730 --> 00:42.140
Are you thinking about... Ru?

01:03.660 --> 01:05.159
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:05.160 --> 01:09.159
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

01:09.160 --> 01:11.899
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:11.900 --> 01:14.769
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:14.770 --> 01:16.069
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:16.070 --> 01:20.279
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:20.280 --> 01:25.279
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

01:25.280 --> 01:29.749
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:29.750 --> 01:32.349
<i>you're there</i>

01:32.350 --> 01:35.159
<i>with a smile</i>

01:35.160 --> 01:40.659
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:40.660 --> 01:44.120
<i>And still</i>

01:45.770 --> 01:48.969
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:48.970 --> 01:53.269
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

01:53.270 --> 01:55.679
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

01:55.680 --> 01:57.349
<i>Now cross</i>

01:57.350 --> 02:00.009
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:00.010 --> 02:07.119
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:07.120 --> 02:13.620
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:25.470 --> 02:26.839
Serious?

02:26.840 --> 02:28.709
Serious, serious, and like...
They're coming...!

02:28.710 --> 02:31.010
See...
What, serious?

02:36.920 --> 02:40.659
That feels so wrong...
So it is true...

02:40.660 --> 02:43.059
Huh...
I guess it was true...

02:43.060 --> 02:45.659
Let me see, let me see!
See, Akira's on it!

02:45.660 --> 02:47.530
Where, where?

02:48.760 --> 02:51.269
Did you see that? The rumored "couple."

02:51.270 --> 02:55.169
Yup, yup! They were walking
side by side like it was nothing.

02:55.170 --> 02:57.669
Weren't the Kurebayashis twins?

02:57.670 --> 03:00.339
But, I heard they're always
eating lunch together.

03:00.340 --> 03:03.109
I know... On the rooftop, right?

03:03.110 --> 03:06.409
But is it true? They are
brother and sister, right?

03:06.410 --> 03:07.949
Maybe it's that they're
a bit too friendly...

03:07.950 --> 03:10.280
Not just "a bit," you know?

03:14.920 --> 03:17.759
Well, see you later.

03:17.760 --> 03:18.920
Yup.

03:35.710 --> 03:37.879
How is she doing...?

03:37.880 --> 03:41.479
Huh? Um, she's with Hitoe now.

03:41.480 --> 03:44.089
But, they haven't been battling at all.

03:44.090 --> 03:45.280
I see...

03:46.390 --> 03:49.589
What about you? Aren't you battling?

03:49.590 --> 03:51.459
N-No...

03:51.460 --> 03:53.489
Why not?

03:53.490 --> 03:55.430
Why not...?

03:57.230 --> 03:58.429
Go ahead, battle.

03:58.430 --> 04:01.130
You go on and continue your battles.

04:04.440 --> 04:07.009
That girl who used to be Yuzuki's LRIG...

04:07.010 --> 04:09.009
probably knows...

04:09.010 --> 04:12.450
that you're different
than the other girls.

04:16.650 --> 04:18.920
- "Model Aoi Akira-<i>chan</i>'s Recommendation" -
"WIXOSS-This ruuules! I'm personally hooked again ♪"

04:16.650 --> 04:18.920
- "I wonder if there are any skilled
- players who will face me, nyaah ♪"

04:19.120 --> 04:22.189
What the heck is Akira thinking?

04:22.190 --> 04:23.280
Well...

04:24.360 --> 04:26.459
Hitoe? What's the matter?

04:26.460 --> 04:28.459
Ah, well...

04:28.460 --> 04:30.769
I was wondering if Ruko is okay.

04:30.770 --> 04:31.530
Huh?

04:31.531 --> 04:35.699
If Akira-<i>san</i> is really a Selector again...

04:35.700 --> 04:38.430
she would go to Ruko for sure, right?

04:44.780 --> 04:48.180
Are you really... not going to battle?

04:52.290 --> 04:55.159
You were enjoying it so much.

04:55.160 --> 04:57.359
You were so passionate...

04:57.360 --> 05:01.000
to the extent your blood
flared, and your body tingled.

05:00.960 --> 05:03.215
"Early Spring Wears"

05:01.001 --> 05:03.215
"Monthly Ron-ron"

05:02.530 --> 05:04.969
Because Tama is gone?

05:03.216 --> 05:05.470
"Ideals and Reality Comes Together!"

05:03.216 --> 05:05.470
"Smart and Cheap Notable Items 50 Picks"

05:04.970 --> 05:07.540
Because I'm your LRIG?

05:05.470 --> 05:07.200
"Preparing for Spring"

05:07.540 --> 05:10.310
It's not fun because
you're not with friends?

05:08.700 --> 05:09.970
"Spring Weight Watching!"

05:10.310 --> 05:13.469
That's why you can't battle?

05:13.470 --> 05:15.979
It makes no sense...

05:15.980 --> 05:19.579
You're the greatest Selector that I know...

05:19.580 --> 05:22.549
and I'm the greatest LRIG.

05:22.550 --> 05:26.019
Us being together yet not
battling can't be forgiven.

05:26.020 --> 05:28.019
What? A new pack came out?

05:28.020 --> 05:29.689
Yup! I just got it!

05:29.690 --> 05:31.759
Aww, can you show it to me?

05:31.760 --> 05:34.199
Don't you like battling?

05:34.200 --> 05:36.429
That's why you're
carrying me with you, right?

05:36.430 --> 05:37.030
No...

05:37.031 --> 05:39.829
Using me as a clue to find Tama is a lie.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.169
You should...

05:41.170 --> 05:44.039
just take advantage
of me to your liking.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.109
Take advantage...?

05:45.110 --> 05:47.579
Take advantage of me...

05:47.580 --> 05:48.939
to make yourself feel better.

05:48.940 --> 05:50.430
That's not...!

05:57.520 --> 05:59.549
Come now...

05:59.550 --> 06:02.859
Selectors seek for
their wish to come true...

06:02.860 --> 06:05.129
LRIGs seek to return
to the outside world...

06:05.130 --> 06:06.929
Each takes advantage of the other.

06:06.930 --> 06:11.929
That's not true! Hanayo-<i>san</i> made
Yuzuki's wish come true for her!

06:11.930 --> 06:14.299
So that she can live in the outside world.

06:14.300 --> 06:16.239
That's not it!

06:16.240 --> 06:18.769
Why do you say so?

06:18.770 --> 06:21.470
What of her do you know?

06:22.480 --> 06:26.409
You don't know anything. Even about Tama...

06:26.410 --> 06:28.149
But, that's fine.

06:28.150 --> 06:30.449
There's no need to know.

06:30.450 --> 06:33.449
Just let each one take
advantage of the other.

06:33.450 --> 06:36.980
So that you can savor
the exhilaration of battle.

06:44.970 --> 06:47.669
That's... not right.

06:47.670 --> 06:51.469
It's... not that I felt
good about battling.

06:51.470 --> 06:54.079
It's because Tama was with me...

06:54.080 --> 06:57.109
I liked being together with Tama...

06:57.110 --> 06:58.609
What are you talking about?

06:58.610 --> 07:03.419
It's not that I liked doing battle.
I liked battling alongside Tama...

07:03.420 --> 07:05.449
I like Tama...

07:05.450 --> 07:08.789
No. You're the same as me.

07:08.790 --> 07:11.789
You only find meaning
in life through battles.

07:11.790 --> 07:15.259
I... want to meet Tama!

07:15.260 --> 07:19.299
Iona-<i>san</i>? Is it true you don't
know what happened to Tama?

07:19.300 --> 07:22.439
It can be anything.
Please tell me anything you know!

07:22.440 --> 07:26.839
I'll do anything and
everything to get Tama back!

07:26.840 --> 07:30.279
So, please! Iona-<i>san</i>!

07:30.280 --> 07:31.110
Who knows...?

07:31.111 --> 07:34.619
Really? You really don't know anything?

07:34.620 --> 07:37.289
She could be with Mayu...

07:37.290 --> 07:40.689
Huh? What did you just say, Iona-<i>san</i>?

07:40.690 --> 07:43.060
Oh, nothing...

07:50.400 --> 07:53.030
Welcome back, Tama.

07:54.970 --> 07:57.739
You won the battle...

07:57.740 --> 08:00.709
Tama... lied to Ru...

08:00.710 --> 08:01.909
Yes.

08:01.910 --> 08:04.979
Tama didn't want to say goodbye.

08:04.980 --> 08:09.149
But, that hurt Ru...

08:09.150 --> 08:12.590
Ru was the one who lied first.

08:19.660 --> 08:24.429
Tama. Let's go shopping for
other stuff besides dumplings.

08:24.430 --> 08:26.029
Shopping?

08:26.030 --> 08:30.239
I'm going to buy you a
matching pair of scrunchies, too.

08:30.240 --> 08:31.769
Ru!

08:31.770 --> 08:33.839
Good bye...

08:33.840 --> 08:36.509
Now you know after
winning the battle, right?

08:36.510 --> 08:38.409
Ru is a liar.

08:38.410 --> 08:41.879
Ru chose her friends before you, Tama.

08:41.880 --> 08:48.790
No! Ru was trying to save Tama and Yuzuki,
Hitoe and everyone! Everyone!

08:49.960 --> 08:52.889
That means she gave up on everyone.

08:52.890 --> 08:55.799
No! Ru was thinking of everyone.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.429
But, Tama was only thinking
of how lonely Tama would be,

08:58.430 --> 09:00.899
and didn't know Ru's feelings at all!

09:00.900 --> 09:03.639
Tama...? Where are you, Tama?!

09:03.640 --> 09:04.440
Ru...?

09:04.441 --> 09:06.740
Tama...!

09:10.110 --> 09:14.449
I'm sorry, Ru... I'm sorry...

09:14.450 --> 09:15.919
Do you want to meet Ru?

09:15.920 --> 09:17.289
Yup...

09:17.290 --> 09:19.089
Meet and apologize to her?

09:19.090 --> 09:20.959
Yup...

09:20.960 --> 09:24.329
You want to return to the outside world?

09:24.330 --> 09:25.729
Yup.

09:25.730 --> 09:28.129
The outside is scary.

09:28.130 --> 09:33.429
The emotions... The soul starts to tangle.

09:33.430 --> 09:35.399
You'll be hurt...

09:35.400 --> 09:37.509
There are liars everywhere...

09:37.510 --> 09:41.839
Pain... and sorrow abounds.

09:41.840 --> 09:44.470
There, can you hear them?

09:45.850 --> 09:48.079
Everyone... is crying.

09:48.080 --> 09:52.089
But, Ru and Grandma are kind.

09:52.090 --> 09:55.159
No! Lies! The outside is scary!

09:55.160 --> 09:57.959
Scary! So, scary...!

09:57.960 --> 09:59.859
No... don't...

09:59.860 --> 10:01.359
I don't want to leave...

10:01.360 --> 10:04.660
I can't handle the
pressure if I leave here...

10:07.640 --> 10:11.040
Let's be together... forever...

10:17.610 --> 10:20.280
Aww, you're too strong.

10:22.450 --> 10:25.849
Let's play together again, forever...

10:25.850 --> 10:30.459
We'll all be here... together... forever...

10:30.460 --> 10:33.959
Tama... knows...

10:33.960 --> 10:37.020
knows her voice.

10:40.800 --> 10:43.469
Ma... yu...?

10:43.470 --> 10:45.460
You remembered me?

10:56.720 --> 10:59.589
So, you want to meet Ru after all?

10:59.590 --> 11:02.089
Yup. I want to.

11:02.090 --> 11:05.259
I might not forgive you... Tama...

11:05.260 --> 11:09.599
But, I still want to meet her...

11:09.600 --> 11:11.669
I see...

11:11.670 --> 11:13.729
Then...

11:13.730 --> 11:15.830
I'll let you meet her.

11:20.780 --> 11:22.439
Just a second.

11:22.440 --> 11:24.609
You'll know looking at it, Ruko.

11:24.610 --> 11:26.279
What we saw is real.

11:26.280 --> 11:27.749
Go ahead, battle.

11:27.750 --> 11:30.719
You go on and continue your battles.

11:30.720 --> 11:31.620
Yuzuki...

11:31.621 --> 11:34.519
Hm? What's the matter, Ruko?

11:34.520 --> 11:36.759
Um, nothing...

11:36.760 --> 11:37.760
Hm?

11:37.761 --> 11:40.590
This here! Look!

11:38.530 --> 11:40.390
- "Super Popular! Rising Model
- Aoi Akira-<i>chan</i>'s Recommendation"

11:38.530 --> 11:40.390
- "WIXOSS-This ruuules! I'm personally hooked
again ♪" - "I wonder if there are any skilled

11:38.530 --> 11:40.390
players who will face me, nyaah ♪"

11:42.060 --> 11:45.760
Akira is looking for Selectors!

11:52.610 --> 11:55.239
She's been posting strange
rumors on the Internet.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.360
Look at this.

11:55.780 --> 11:58.445
are mysterious LRIG
cards that can grant wishes"

11:56.361 --> 11:57.865
"Aoi Akira"

11:57.866 --> 11:59.950
"Did you know? There's
a rumor that says there

11:58.446 --> 12:02.949
Mysterious LRIG cards
that can grant wishes...?

12:02.950 --> 12:08.319
It looks like Akira-<i>san</i> is trying to spread
word of Selectors across the Internet.

12:08.320 --> 12:10.659
She has more fans than before.

12:10.660 --> 12:13.429
It's been retweeted
over 5,000 times already.

12:13.430 --> 12:17.899
At this rate...
So like, the WIXOSS LRIG cards can speak.

12:17.900 --> 12:20.099
Then like, you can get
your wish to come true.

12:20.100 --> 12:21.799
Isn't that from the novel?

12:21.800 --> 12:24.939
That's stupid. No one's
gonna believe the rumor.

12:24.940 --> 12:27.269
Come to think of it, didn't Akira
talk about it on the Internet?

12:27.270 --> 12:27.810
Oh yeah,

12:27.810 --> 12:29.979
Those girls don't know anything at all...

12:27.811 --> 12:29.980
and like, isn't Akira
looking good again recently?

12:29.980 --> 12:31.149
Yeah, I know!

12:31.150 --> 12:35.079
Don't worry, no one's going to believe it.

12:35.080 --> 12:38.249
We can't be so sure.
We have to do something.

12:38.250 --> 12:39.789
Something...?

12:39.790 --> 12:42.189
I don't know, but we can't let this be.

12:42.190 --> 12:45.960
Why the heck is Akira doing this...?

12:47.130 --> 12:48.629
Akira-<i>san...</i>

12:48.630 --> 12:50.629
is really pretty.

12:50.630 --> 12:51.769
Hitoe!

12:51.770 --> 12:53.969
This isn't the time to be
praising the likes of her!

12:53.970 --> 12:56.839
Ah! I-I'm sorry...

12:56.840 --> 13:01.139
But really, she looks
prettier than before...

13:01.140 --> 13:03.039
The scar on her face is gone too.

13:03.040 --> 13:05.649
I'm sure she can cover that up with makeup.

13:05.650 --> 13:06.949
Really?

13:06.950 --> 13:09.119
She... still had the scar.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.949
Huh?
What?

13:10.950 --> 13:14.319
Akira-<i>san</i> still had the scar on her face.

13:14.320 --> 13:15.719
You met Akira?!

13:15.720 --> 13:16.789
Yup...

13:16.790 --> 13:19.529
So she did go to you, Ruko.

13:19.530 --> 13:21.459
Were you okay?

13:21.460 --> 13:22.460
Yup...

13:22.461 --> 13:23.699
You didn't...

13:23.700 --> 13:25.199
I did.

13:25.200 --> 13:28.330
I... battled against Akira-<i>san.</i>

13:33.870 --> 13:38.409
Urith... Urith... Urith...

13:38.410 --> 13:42.540
Urith... Urith...

13:43.580 --> 13:45.589
You beat Kominato Ruko?

13:45.590 --> 13:50.889
Someone got in the way, so I couldn't
finish her, but I did beat her up bad!

13:50.890 --> 13:53.689
I can crush them anytime I want easily!

13:53.690 --> 13:55.359
So...!

13:55.360 --> 13:57.429
Thank you...

13:57.430 --> 14:00.499
I knew you would pull through for me.

14:00.500 --> 14:02.069
Urith...

14:02.070 --> 14:03.899
It's all because of you, Urith.

14:03.900 --> 14:06.939
I became stronger because of Urith's love.

14:06.940 --> 14:08.409
Oh?

14:08.410 --> 14:10.579
But...

14:10.580 --> 14:12.909
What?! Stop...!

14:12.910 --> 14:14.940
Why are you hiding it?

14:16.620 --> 14:19.189
That's not all, is it?

14:19.190 --> 14:21.189
Come, show me...

14:21.190 --> 14:23.859
Your most unsightly part...

14:23.860 --> 14:27.459
Your splattered rotten, filthy parts...

14:27.460 --> 14:29.099
Or is it...

14:29.100 --> 14:31.099
that you can't show it to me?

14:31.100 --> 14:32.129
Urith!

14:32.130 --> 14:34.900
No! No! Urith!

14:38.110 --> 14:41.309
I'm not hiding... I'm not hiding it!

14:41.310 --> 14:43.279
I can show anything to Urith!

14:43.280 --> 14:45.149
I'll do anything that Urith wants me to do!

14:45.150 --> 14:47.309
I don't mind killing Ruko!

14:47.310 --> 14:48.479
So please...

14:48.480 --> 14:50.619
Please, Urith...

14:50.620 --> 14:52.549
Love me...

14:52.550 --> 14:55.119
Make Akira more and more...

14:55.120 --> 14:57.459
into Aki-lovely.

14:57.460 --> 14:58.980
Please...!

15:00.660 --> 15:04.429
So the battle ended prematurely?!

15:04.430 --> 15:05.769
Thank goodness...

15:05.770 --> 15:10.069
Nothing good about it!
Why'd you battle her?!

15:10.070 --> 15:15.939
I had a bad feeling... that if I refused,
something worse would happen.

15:15.940 --> 15:19.579
Excuses. Honestly, you
wanted to battle, right?

15:19.580 --> 15:20.180
Huh?

15:20.181 --> 15:22.149
Yuzuki, that's a bit...

15:22.150 --> 15:24.519
You... still have Iona with you, right?

15:24.520 --> 15:26.010
Um...

15:31.290 --> 15:33.089
Is that true?

15:33.090 --> 15:34.030
Yup...

15:34.031 --> 15:36.259
Because you want to meet Tama-<i>chan</i>?

15:36.260 --> 15:36.930
Yup...

15:36.931 --> 15:40.960
You might not meet her if
you lose your battle, you know?

15:42.500 --> 15:43.440
Petty...

15:43.441 --> 15:45.639
You'll make your grandma worried too.

15:45.640 --> 15:46.610
Nonsense...

15:46.611 --> 15:48.209
I know that, but...

15:48.210 --> 15:49.839
I'm not like either of you...

15:49.840 --> 15:53.180
We spoke about thinking together for Tama!

15:54.380 --> 15:58.119
Ruko can only sense life in battle...

15:58.120 --> 16:01.819
We told you not to carry
all the burden by yourself.

16:01.820 --> 16:03.389
She's like me.

16:03.390 --> 16:06.359
An existence that should be with me, but...

16:06.360 --> 16:09.529
It's... not that I felt
good about battling.

16:09.530 --> 16:11.799
Are the girls here at fault?

16:11.800 --> 16:15.499
These girls are misleading Ruko...

16:15.500 --> 16:18.469
We feel the same as you do, Ruko.

16:18.470 --> 16:19.809
Huh?

16:19.810 --> 16:22.909
As much as you have
feelings towards Tama...

16:22.910 --> 16:26.749
me and Hitoe have the same
feelings towards you too, Ruko.

16:26.750 --> 16:28.749
Ruko...

16:28.750 --> 16:33.089
We won't like it just as much
if you disappeared, Ruko.

16:33.090 --> 16:34.759
Yuzuki...

16:34.760 --> 16:39.429
Ruko... when you won
the battle against Iona-<i>san,</i>

16:39.430 --> 16:43.359
it dawned on me that I wouldn't like it.

16:43.360 --> 16:47.269
I worried what would happen if
Ruko actually became an LRIG.

16:47.270 --> 16:51.109
I was worried about you disappearing.

16:51.110 --> 16:52.739
Hitoe...

16:52.740 --> 16:58.709
Ruko, you tried to sacrifice yourself for,
not only Tama-<i>chan</i>, but for us too, right?

16:58.710 --> 17:02.419
But Hitoe, you did the
same for Yuzuki, too.

17:02.420 --> 17:03.120
Yup.

17:03.121 --> 17:07.719
I thought... no matter what happens
to me, I'll do anything for Yuzuki.

17:07.720 --> 17:10.950
But... that's just wrong!

17:12.430 --> 17:16.699
I finally got it, just when you
were about to disappear...

17:16.700 --> 17:22.099
Ruko, if you disappeared,
I wouldn't be happy.

17:22.100 --> 17:25.309
Ruko, if you sacrificed yourself, maybe...

17:25.310 --> 17:32.249
I could have had a normal life, been able
to talk with Yuzuki, and make other friends...

17:32.250 --> 17:33.779
but...

17:33.780 --> 17:39.480
But if you weren't there,
Ruko, it wouldn't be fun at all.

17:40.990 --> 17:42.919
Hitoe...

17:42.920 --> 17:47.259
I... spoke with Hitoe afterwards...

17:47.260 --> 17:50.799
about sacrificing yourself for others.

17:50.800 --> 17:53.670
To stop doing stuff like that already.

17:55.440 --> 17:57.339
We'll always be together.

17:57.340 --> 17:59.809
When we're suffering,
we'll suffer together.

17:59.810 --> 18:02.609
When we're sad, we'll be sad together.

18:02.610 --> 18:05.749
We'll do this, for as long as we know.

18:05.750 --> 18:09.180
Hitoe... Yuzuki...

18:10.480 --> 18:12.689
I●●●

18:12.690 --> 18:17.829
thought of doing
anything to get Tama back.

18:17.830 --> 18:19.359
But...

18:19.360 --> 18:22.799
Sorry... I'm sorry...

18:22.800 --> 18:25.699
I won't act on my own again.

18:25.700 --> 18:28.339
I won't do battles on my own again.

18:28.340 --> 18:31.269
But, please...

18:31.270 --> 18:32.539
We understand.

18:32.540 --> 18:34.709
For the sake of Tama-<i>chan...</i>

18:34.710 --> 18:38.379
To stop other girls from
experiencing any more sorrows...

18:38.380 --> 18:40.779
if you need to battle...

18:40.780 --> 18:41.879
we won't stop you.

18:41.880 --> 18:44.819
But like, be sure you tell us, okay?

18:44.820 --> 18:48.159
Yup. Thank you...

18:48.160 --> 18:49.680
Thank you...

19:06.840 --> 19:08.809
Hm? Yuzuki?

19:08.810 --> 19:11.340
Ah... Sorry.

19:18.320 --> 19:20.849
Mmm... So much red bean...!

19:20.850 --> 19:23.219
All that crying must've made us hungry.

19:23.220 --> 19:24.759
Yup!

19:24.760 --> 19:26.159
What are you doing?

19:26.160 --> 19:29.699
Well then, we should have
grabbed a bite back there.

19:29.700 --> 19:31.599
But...

19:31.600 --> 19:33.199
What are you saying?

19:33.200 --> 19:36.099
All that crying back there
made it embarrassing to stay.

19:36.100 --> 19:37.339
Ruko...

19:37.340 --> 19:40.039
You're not one of them.

19:40.040 --> 19:42.839
Well, not like I can eat
or anything, you know?

19:42.840 --> 19:44.509
But can you smell food?

19:44.510 --> 19:47.409
I became an LRIG just for you...

19:47.410 --> 19:50.519
Come to think of it, do
LRIGs ever get hungry?

19:50.520 --> 19:53.449
Well no, but this has
nothing to do with it, right?

19:53.450 --> 19:56.450
To become one with you in battle...

19:57.560 --> 20:00.080
Don't let me down...

20:04.030 --> 20:05.299
What's the matter?

20:05.300 --> 20:06.599
I sense...

20:06.600 --> 20:08.769
I sense another LRIG!

20:08.770 --> 20:10.369
There's a Selector nearby!

20:10.370 --> 20:11.740
Which way?

20:12.740 --> 20:13.769
In that direction!

20:13.770 --> 20:15.900
Ruko.
Okay!

20:18.650 --> 20:20.310
This sense...

20:28.460 --> 20:31.290
That's... Urith?!

20:33.290 --> 20:34.599
I knew it...

20:34.600 --> 20:36.429
Huh? Hm?

20:36.430 --> 20:37.400
Chiyori!

20:37.401 --> 20:39.999
Yaaargh! We meet again-y!

20:40.000 --> 20:43.269
Oh my! The whole gang is here!

20:43.270 --> 20:46.639
Why, oh why? Hey! Could this be fate?!

20:46.640 --> 20:50.139
The beautiful Selector warriors of
love and courage come together?!

20:50.140 --> 20:52.609
Wow, did you just call
yourself "beautiful"?

20:52.610 --> 20:55.649
It's been quite a while... scum.

20:55.650 --> 20:58.980
What? Why are you with Chiyori-<i>san</i>?

21:01.120 --> 21:02.289
It can't be...

21:02.290 --> 21:04.519
No way...

21:04.520 --> 21:07.459
Now, let's begin, Chiyori.

21:07.460 --> 21:11.090
Let's do it, do it! Let's do battle!

21:14.530 --> 21:15.470
<i>Open</i>!

21:15.471 --> 21:16.700
No!

21:45.700 --> 21:46.969
Ta...

21:46.970 --> 21:48.330
Tama...?!

21:52.470 --> 21:55.910
"That Accidental Reunion"

22:02.320 --> 22:03.879
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.880 --> 22:09.319
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.320 --> 22:13.889
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.890 --> 22:15.499
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.500 --> 22:21.069
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.070 --> 22:25.769
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.770 --> 22:31.239
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.240 --> 22:37.419
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.420 --> 22:42.559
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.560 --> 22:50.560
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.300 --> 22:59.409
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.410 --> 23:06.109
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:06.110 --> 23:11.119
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:11.120 --> 23:13.789
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.790 --> 23:20.890
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.600 --> 23:28.939
Battle staaart!

23:28.940 --> 23:31.299
I go first. Grow.

23:31.300 --> 23:32.939
Now it's getting fun!

23:32.940 --> 23:34.309
Wish Crisis!

23:34.310 --> 23:37.639
Chorizo De Ibéricoña The Second!

23:37.640 --> 23:38.680
Lookie!

23:38.681 --> 23:39.810
"Those Wild Delusions"

23:39.811 --> 23:40.910
Those Wild Delusions.
